   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>You survive via chance and charity. You’re often exposed to natural dangers as a result of sleeping outside. (Tons)      AC     HP    Damage Threshold            Cost 1            13     300           —               40,000 GP</p>",
